WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.405 --> 00:00:03.661
Unit seventeen. Days of the Week!

2
00:00:04.777 --> 00:00:09.651
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Sophea. Welcome back!

3
00:00:09.701 --> 00:00:13.474
Hi, Teacher Sophea! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.524 --> 00:00:17.495
Today we learn: Days of the Week. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.623 --> 00:00:22.073
Monday. Say it with me. Monday!

6
00:00:25.538 --> 00:00:29.172
Tuesday. Say it with me. Tuesday!

7
00:00:32.677 --> 00:00:36.677
Wednesday. Say it with me. Wednesday!

8
00:00:40.166 --> 00:00:43.966
Thursday. Say it with me. Thursday!

9
00:00:47.465 --> 00:00:50.898
Friday. Say it with me. Friday!

10
00:00:54.401 --> 00:00:58.201
Weekend. Say it with me. Weekend!

11
00:01:01.699 --> 00:01:05.332
Today. Say it with me. Today!

12
00:01:08.831 --> 00:01:12.281
Tomorrow. Say it with me. Tomorrow!

13
00:01:15.793 --> 00:01:26.701
Grammar time! On + day of the week. Listen. I have art class on Monday. I play football on Friday.

14
00:01:26.751 --> 00:01:34.036
Your turn. Say it with me. I have art class on Monday. I play football on Friday.

15
00:01:39.021 --> 00:01:50.640
There are seven days in a week. I go to school from Monday to Friday. Saturday and Sunday are the weekend, when I rest and play. Today is a school day, but tomorrow might be the weekend!

16
00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:51.979
I like this story!

17
00:01:52.849 --> 00:01:58.274
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:58.324 --> 00:01:59.524
Wednesday!

19
00:02:00.714 --> 00:02:05.969
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:06.019 --> 00:02:07.169
Today!

21
00:02:08.114 --> 00:02:16.424
Think and answer. What is your favorite day of the week, and why?

22
00:02:16.474 --> 00:02:17.624
Great answer!

23
00:02:18.684 --> 00:02:21.368
This unit's value is Time Management.

24
00:02:21.418 --> 00:02:23.476
I can show time management every day!

25
00:02:24.147 --> 00:02:28.744
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

26
00:02:28.794 --> 00:02:30.439
Bye-bye, friends!

